    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Axis" kindref="compound">Axis</ref> title and its placement, grouped as the <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Axis" kindref="compound">Axis</ref> <computeroutput>label</computeroutput> property, e.g. <computeroutput>label.text: &quot;Time (s)&quot;</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The title is painted inside the axis item and clipped to it. <computeroutput>delegate</computeroutput> replaces it with a QML item.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Axis" kindref="compound">Axis</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
